## As an MCP server

`{{ .Tool }} serve` offers the same commands as MCP tools, with the same arguments and the same JSON
in each result. Flags become arguments with underscores: `--max-bytes` is `max_bytes`. Writes take
`confirm` and `dry_run` arguments.
